# Build context: sources only. The image runs its own `npm ci` and production build, so local
# installs and build output never enter it — and local-only env files (Vite loads `.env*.local` in
# every mode) can never be baked into the production bundle. Committed `.env` / `.env.production`
# defaults stay in the context on purpose.
node_modules
dist
.git
.github
.env*.local
*.log
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
